li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-1a2646dd35b8aab1END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-cae613d7e38409bfEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_UNI_WYR_VulnerablePatriars</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_VulnerablePatriars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_VulnerablePatriars\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">e82a8b27-ebe2-4ec1-83ba-256769a5c559</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e82a8b27-ebe2-4ec1-83ba-256769a5c559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e82a8b27-ebe2-4ec1-83ba-256769a5c559\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On the top floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Fortress\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Fortress\">Wyrm's Rock Fortress</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;24&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;220</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Lord <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Gortash</a> - \n</p><p>Obedience before all! Based on their levels of influence cross-indexed with vulnerability to various forms of pressure (bribery, blackmail, direct threats), the following are the top eight Peers in Parliament to target in the next two tendays: \n</p><p>1. Duke <a href=\"/wiki/Dillard_Portyr\" title=\"Dillard Portyr\">Dillard Portyr</a>\n</p><p>2. Lord <a href=\"/wiki/Raylen_Jannath\" title=\"Raylen Jannath\">Raylen Jannath</a> \n</p><p>3. Lady <a href=\"/wiki/Ruth_Linnacker\" title=\"Ruth Linnacker\">Ruth Linnacker</a>\n</p><p>4. Lady <a href=\"/wiki/Madeline_Whitburn\" title=\"Madeline Whitburn\">Madeline Whitburn</a>\n</p><p>5. Lord <a href=\"/wiki/Rillyn\" title=\"Rillyn\">Hir Rillyn</a>\n</p><p>6. Lady <a href=\"/wiki/Vanthampur\" title=\"Vanthampur\">Haeril Vanthampur</a>\n</p><p>7. Lady <a href=\"/wiki/Silifrey_Sashenstar\" title=\"Silifrey Sashenstar\">Silifrey Sashenstar</a>\n</p><p>8. Lord <a href=\"/wiki/Sarken_Eomane\" title=\"Sarken Eomane\">Sarken Eomane</a><br><br> - With utmost respect, the Black Hand of Loyalty\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234336\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1603/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31664/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8771/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936270/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.583      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.583      1 -total\n 55.85%   23.225      7 Template:Icon_text\n 49.71%   20.671     17 Template:Trim\n 23.49%    9.769      2 Template:Uid\n 15.04%    6.256      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.10%    5.448      2 Template:Icon_link\n 13.01%    5.408      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.43%    4.336      1 Template:Notes\n 10.01%    4.164      1 Template:Ifexist\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12457-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714234336 and revision id 362739. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}